        requirements = nil,
        walkthrough = '1. Go to Ro\'Maeve. You will need Sneak and Invisible through this area, but everything in-zone detects magic, so use Silent Oils and Prism Powders or cast Sneak and Invisible at the zone.\n   - You can now also use a mount in this zone.\n2. If you have it, Survival Guide to Ro\'Maeve is the fastest way, it puts you right at the zone to Hall of the Gods.\n   - Unity Warp (125) will put you at the entrance of Ro\'Maeve.\n3. Head for (H-5) and zone in to Hall of the Gods.\n4. Run through the hallway and check the Cermet Grate two times. You will now be on the next mission.',
